      <p class="related-resources-title">Additional resources</p>
      <ul><li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/applications/quotas/quotas-setting-per-project#quotas-setting-per-project_quotas-setting-per-project">Resource quotas per projects</a></li></ul>
      </section>
